{"id":62782,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-09-03T12:53:36","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T11:53:36","slug":"trail-do-zezere","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-do-zezere\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail do Z\u00eazere 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail do Z\u00eazere 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>11\u00ba Trail do Z\u00eazere 2026<\/strong> \u00e9 uma das mais consagradas e espectaculares provas de trail running da bacia hidrogr\u00e1fica do <strong>Rio Z\u00eazere<\/strong> e da <strong>Albufeira de Castelo do Bode<\/strong>, acolhida na vila de <strong>Ferreira do Z\u00eazere<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com sede no <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal de Ferreira do Z\u00eazere<\/strong>, a prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial da <strong>ATRP<\/strong> e da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Santar\u00e9m, contando com os desafiantes percursos de <strong>Grande Trail K49 (49 km com +2646m D+)<\/strong>, <strong>Trail K33 (33 km)<\/strong> com o Desafio Z\u00eazere Vertical, <strong>Pequeno Trail K22 (22 km)<\/strong>, <strong>Mini Trail K13 (13 km)<\/strong>, <strong>Caminhada<\/strong>, <strong>C\u00e3ominhada<\/strong> e o <strong>Trailinho Kids<\/strong>. Organizado pelo <strong>Clube de Atletismo de Ferreira do Z\u00eazere<\/strong> com cronometragem Lap2Go, inclui abastecimentos com gastronomia local, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica e medalha de finalista.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">14 e 15 de Novembro de 2026 \u00e0s 07:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; b